<BaseLayout
  title="Benchmarking Speculative Decoding: What the Numbers Don't Tell You | Catpuccino.ai"
  description="A practitioner's guide to measuring speculative decoding fairly — the five variables (τ, c, γ, batch size, backend) that turn a single speedup claim into a complete picture."
  crumb="Spec Decoding Benchmarking"
