  </div>
</div>

<p>The numbers from the EAGLE-3 paper are unambiguous. At batch size 1, EAGLE achieves ~3× latency speedup and EAGLE-3 reaches ~5.6×. At batch size 64:</p>

<table class="results-table">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Method</th><th>Batch=1 latency speedup</th><th>Batch=64 throughput ratio</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="mn">Autoregressive baseline</td>
