<!-- Listen-friendly content -->
<div class="listen-friendly-content" style="display: none;" aria-hidden="true">
  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: Benchmarking Speculative Decoding</h2>
    <p>Speculative decoding accelerates LLM inference by having a cheap draft model propose multiple tokens that the large target model then verifies in parallel. The key metric is τ, the mean acceptance length — how many draft tokens pass verification per cycle. But τ alone does not determine speedup. The formula is: speedup equals τ divided by one plus gamma times c, where gamma is the maximum draft tokens per cycle and c is the ratio of draft latency to verify latency.</p>
    <p>Five variables determine observed speedup: task type, temperature, batch size, backend framework, and draft cost ratio c. Math benchmarks like GSM8K give τ values of seven to eight because digit and operator sequences are highly predictable. Conversational tasks like MT-Bench give τ of three to four because responses are more diverse. The same method, DFlash, scores six times speedup on GSM8K but only two-point-seven-five on MT-Bench. EAGLE at batch sixty-four actually slows throughput to zero-point-nine-nine times the baseline. DFlash reduces draft cost by using parallel diffusion generation — all sixteen draft tokens in one forward pass — rather than sixteen sequential passes, cutting c from zero-point-seventeen to zero-point-zero-two. A fair benchmark reports τ, c, speedup at batch one, throughput at batch sixty-four, across at least three task categories, at both temperature zero and one.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：推测解码性能评测指南</h2>
    <p>推测解码通过让一个轻量草稿模型批量提议多个词元，再由大模型并行验证，从而加速LLM推理。核心指标是τ，即每轮的平均接受长度。但τ本身并不决定加速比，完整公式为：加速比等于τ除以（1加γ乘以c），其中γ是每轮最大草稿词元数，c是草稿延迟与验证延迟之比。</p>
    <p>决定实测加速比的五个变量是：任务类型、采样温度、批次大小、推理框架，以及草稿代价比c。数学类任务（如GSM8K）因数字和运算符序列高度可预测，τ可达7至8；对话类任务（如MT-Bench）输出更多样，τ仅为3至4。DFlash在GSM8K上获得六倍加速，在MT-Bench上仅有2.75倍。EAGLE在批次大小64时吞吐量实际下降至基线的0.99倍。DFlash通过并行扩散生成（单次前向传播生成全部16个草稿词元）将c从0.17降至0.02。公平的基准评测应同时报告τ、c、批次为1时的延迟加速比、批次为64时的吞吐提升，并跨越至少三类任务，在温度0和温度1两种条件下分别测量。</p>
  </div>
</div>

