<span class="cs-line cmt"># Verify step runs K=64 sequences in parallel —</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># but the spec decode tree adds extra "virtual"</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># sequences to verify, increasing the effective</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># batch further. If memory bandwidth is no longer</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># the bottleneck, the drafting overhead is pure cost.</span>
<span class="cs-line"></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-p cmt"># Rule: for batch &gt;= 32, always measure</span>
